        "body": {
          "value": "<p><span>Minister of Ports, Shipping and Waterways (MoPSW), Shri Sarbananda Sonowal, visited The Energy and Resources Institute’s (TERI) Gwal Pahari campus in Gurugram and reviewed a series of green shipping initiatives, positioning the sector's decarbonisation as a priority area for his ministry.</span></p>",
